<section class="visit-guide section" aria-labelledby="visit-guide-title">
  <div class="visit-guide__heading reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Your nails, your point of view</p>
    <h2 id="visit-guide-title">Let’s start with<br /><em>what you love.</em></h2>
    <p>A colour you keep saving. A length that works for your day. A detail that feels like you. Give Bianca a little context so you can discuss the right appointment.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="visit-guide__items">
    <article class="reveal"><span>01 / Shape & length</span><h3>Think about your everyday.</h3><p>Do you prefer a shorter shape or a little more length? Mention what you are comfortable wearing, along with any reference photos you want to discuss.</p></article>
    <article class="reveal"><span>02 / Colour & detail</span><h3>Bring your inspiration.</h3><p>Save a few Pinterest references for the colour, finish or detail you like. A reference starts the conversation; Bianca can discuss what is achievable for your nails.</p></article>
    <article class="reveal"><span>03 / Your starting point</span><h3>Tell us what’s on your nails.</h3><p>Include whether you currently have gel, extensions or other product. Ask about removal, appointment length and price before confirming your visit.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
